  "notes": "USAGE:\n- {憎|にく}らしい⟦{顔|かお}→顔：00558_kao⟧ (irritating face)\n- {憎|にく}らしい⟦{態度|たいど}→態度：03396_taido⟧ (hateful attitude)\n- {憎|にく}らしいほど (annoyingly, so much that it's hateful)\nOften used with a sense of envy or frustration rather than pure hatred. Can imply 'irritatingly good' when used with ほど.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{憎|にく}い→憎い：12744_nikui⟧ (hateful - stronger, more direct)\n- ⟦{憎|にく}む→憎む：00318_nikumu⟧ (to hate - verb)\n- ⟦{憎|にく}しみ→憎しみ：15769_nikushimi⟧ (hatred - noun)\n\nFORMS:\n- Adverb: {憎|にく}らしく\n- Noun form: {憎|にく}らしさ",
